# This directory holds all trained state produced by the offline training plane:
# models, scalers, encoders, entity profiles, cohort priors, thresholds, fusion weights,
# calibration, the SHAP background sample, the generated dataset and metrics.json.
#
# Binaries are git-ignored on purpose -- only this file and manifest.json are tracked.
# Rebuild everything with:
#   python -m data_generator.generate ; python -m training.build_artifacts
